Descent's game data goes in this drawer
=======================================

D1X-Rebirth is the engine only. It needs the data files of Descent 1,
which are not included:

  descent.hog
  descent.pig

Copy them into this drawer (Data, beside the Descent program). Names may
be in any case. The game also finds them in the Descent drawer itself.

Either data set works:

- The shareware release of Descent 1 (version 1.4), which Parallax and
  Interplay let anyone copy unchanged: the first 7 levels. Its archive
  (for example d1shar14.zip, or descent1.4 shareware for DOS) holds
  descent.hog and descent.pig.
- The full game (registered 1.4 or 1.5, from your own CD or a store
  copy): all 27 levels and the secret ones. Copy descent.hog and
  descent.pig from its directory, after patching to 1.4 or 1.5.

Optional extras go here too: custom missions in a "missions" drawer you
make here, and demos in "demos".

The game writes its settings (descent.cfg), pilots (*.plr), saved games
and screenshots in the Descent drawer, so that drawer must not be
write-protected.
